*PARAMETERS: p_num(30) TYPE c. 
 
"variavel para o select-options 
DATA: V_NUM TYPE EKKO-EBELN. 
 
"puxa dois pedidos de compra 
SELECT-OPTIONS S_NUM FOR V_NUM. 
 
START-OF-SELECTION. 
 
 
FORM z_feed_table. 
 
  SELECT ebeln bukrs ernam 
  INTO TABLE it_ekko 
  FROM ekko 
  WHERE ebeln IN S_num. 
 
 
  IF it_ekko IS NOT INITIAL. 
 
    SELECT ebeln ebelp matnr NETPR NETWR 
    INTO TABLE it_ekpo 
    FROM ekpo 
    FOR ALL ENTRIES IN it_ekko 
    WHERE ebeln = it_ekko-ebeln. 
 
    SELECT ebeln ebelp wemng menge 
    INTO TABLE it_eket 
    FROM eket 
    FOR ALL ENTRIES IN it_ekko 
    WHERE ebeln = it_ekko-ebeln. 
 
    SELECT ebeln ebelp vgabe 
    INTO TABLE it_ekbe 
    FROM ekbe 
    FOR ALL ENTRIES IN it_ekko 
    WHERE ebeln = it_ekko-ebeln. 
 
  ENDIF. 
 
 
 
  LOOP AT it_ekko INTO wa_ekko. 
 
    wa_alv-ebeln = wa_ekko-ebeln. 
    wa_alv-bukrs = wa_ekko-bukrs. 
    wa_alv-ernam = wa_ekko-ernam. 
 
 
    LOOP AT it_ekpo INTO wa_ekpo WHERE ebeln = wa_ekko-ebeln. 
      wa_alv-ebelp = wa_ekpo-ebelp. 
      wa_alv-matnr = wa_ekpo-matnr. 
      wa_alv-NETPR =  wa_ekpo-NETPR. 
      wa_alv-netwr = wa_ekpo-netwr. 
 
      wa_collect-ebeln = wa_ekko-ebeln. 
      wa_collect-netwr = wa_ekpo-netwr. 
 
      COLLECT wa_collect INTO it_collect. 
 
 
      READ TABLE it_eket INTO wa_eket WITH KEY ebeln = wa_ekko-ebeln 
                                               ebelp = wa_ekpo-ebelp. 
      IF sy-subrc IS INITIAL. 
        wa_alv-wemng = wa_eket-wemng. 
        wa_alv-ebelp = wa_ekpo-ebelp. 
        wa_alv-menge = wa_eket-menge. 
      ENDIF. 
 
      READ TABLE it_ekbe INTO wa_ekbe WITH KEY ebeln = wa_ekko-ebeln 
                                               ebelp = wa_ekpo-ebelp. 
      IF sy-subrc IS INITIAL. 
        wa_alv-vgabe = wa_ekbe-vgabe. 
        wa_alv-ebelp = wa_ekpo-ebelp. 
      ENDIF. 
 
      APPEND wa_alv TO it_alv. 
 
BREAK-POINT. 
    ENDLOOP. 
 
  ENDLOOP. 
 
 
ENDFORM. 
 
